     ],
     "why": "A click on a disabled option takes no focus. In a browser the keyboard goes to the body, where select.js hears no keys, so arrow_down and enter do nothing while the list stays open. On a hotty host it goes to the terminal, which gives the keys to the program (SPEC \u00a710.1), and the open list takes them: enter chooses Apple. Every later step follows from that choice."
